HST Office: KeyTips on the ribbon, as in Office.

Alt alone shows key letters on the tabs, a letter opens the tab and shows the letters of its commands, a further letter
runs the command, Esc goes back one level. Alt+letter opens the tab directly. The letters of Office are used where the
same tab or command exists; the others get a free letter when the tab is shown.

