+/// Gives a ribbon its KeyTips: Alt alone shows key letters on the tabs, a letter opens that tab and
+/// shows the letters of its commands, a further letter runs the command, Esc goes back one level.
+/// Alt+letter opens the tab directly. The object lives as long as the tab control.
+void Attach(TabControl& rTabs, NotebookBar& rBar, ToolBox* pQuickAccess, vcl::Window* pBanner);
+}
