+// HST Office: key letters of the ribbon (KeyTips). Pure data and the assignment rule, without VCL
+// types, so that a unit test can compile this header on its own.
+//
+// Tab letters follow the access keys Microsoft documents for Word, Excel and PowerPoint. Command
+// letters follow the Office ribbon where the same command exists; every other command gets a free
+// letter when its tab is shown, so a key never needs to be listed here to work.
+
